   ],
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "Saad applies the same lens to climate change."
    },
    {
     "text": "He isn't denying warming. His target is the emotional climate around it: groups like BirthStrike, whose members pledged not to have children because of the climate crisis."
    },
    {
     "text": "To an evolutionary psychologist, choosing not to reproduce out of empathy for the planet is about as pure an example of suicidal empathy as there is."
    },
    {
     "text": "Climate scientists broadly agree that humans are warming the planet. The real debate is about trade-offs: how fast to cut emissions, at what cost, and who pays."
    }
   ]
  },
