   ],
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "He also points to sport, where a 2024 UN report counted hundreds of medals lost by female athletes to male-born competitors, and to a California prison case, where an inmate who transferred to a women's prison was later accused of sexually assaulting women there."
    },
    {
     "text": "On the other side, several major US medical bodies still support individual care, and trans people face high rates of distress and discrimination that deserve real compassion."
    },
    {
     "text": "Where both sides should agree: young patients deserve the best evidence, published in full, whatever it shows."
    }
   ]
