   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "Semmelweis wasn't right because he was a rebel. He was right because he had data, and the establishment wouldn't look at it."
    },
    {
     "text": "The lesson cuts both ways. Follow the evidence, especially when it's inconvenient, and especially when someone tells you that asking questions is unkind."
